 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>3D</strong><small>Cesium terrain and 3D tiles</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" id="mapType3d" aria-pressed="false">Show</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Satellite</strong><small>Satellite imagery source is not configured</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Satellite not configured">Unavailable</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Terrain</strong><small>Terrain is provided by the active 3D map</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" aria-pressed="true" aria-label="Terrain active">Active</button></div>
 <div class="sr-sheet-section-title">Map details</div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Traffic flow</strong><small>TomTom relative-speed vector tiles; unobserved segments remain gray</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" id="trafficToggle" aria-pressed="false">Hidden</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Weather / rainfall</strong><small>Current rainfall evidence and AI interpretation</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-ai-module="weather">Open</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Verified hazards</strong><small>Reference hazards and route-context analysis</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-ai-module="hazards">Open</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Flood assessment</strong><small>Live source when configured; otherwise labelled contextual analysis</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-ai-module="flood">Open</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Dam / water safety</strong><small>Live source when configured; static dam locations remain reference-only</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-ai-module="dam">Open</button></div>
 <div class="sr-sheet-section-title">AI monitoring</div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>AI Monitor</strong><small>Open the data-grounded AI control center</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" id="mapAiMonitorButton">Open</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Place names</strong><small>SafeRoute town and district labels</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-detail="labels" aria-pressed="true">Shown</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Hospitals</strong><small>Built-in reference locations</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-detail="hospital" aria-pressed="true">Shown</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Police</strong><small>Built-in reference locations</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-detail="police" aria-pressed="true">Shown</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Fuel</strong><small>OpenStreetMap places in the current view</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-poi="fuel" aria-pressed="false">Hidden</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Tourist places</strong><small>OpenStreetMap places in the current view</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-poi="tourist" aria-pressed="false">Hidden</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Viewpoints</strong><small>OpenStreetMap places in the current view</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-poi="viewpoint" aria-pressed="false">Hidden</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Parking</strong><small>OpenStreetMap places in the current view</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" data-map-poi="parking" aria-pressed="false">Hidden</button></div>
 <div class="sr-control-row"><div class="sr-control-copy"><strong>Roads</strong><small>Named roads are available through search; no separate overlay source</small></div><button class="sr-toggle" type="button" aria-disabled="true" aria-label="Road overlay not configured">Unavailable</button></div>
